ed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-28T16:05:08Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T16:01:15Z","closed_at":"2026-07-05T16:00:27Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120715","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120715","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120715.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120715.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-05T16:00:27Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120673\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for implicit conversion of `bool` constants to `float`, `int`, and `uint` during constant conversion.\r\nCurrently, the shader compiler rejects boolean literals in constructors unless they are explicitly cast, which breaks valid GLSL cases like `vec3(false)`\r\n\r\nBoolean constant values are now treated as:\r\n- `false → 0`\r\n- `true → 1`\r\n\r\nThis allows expressions such as:\r\n```glsl\r\nconst vec3 v = vec3(false);\r\nconst ivec4 i = ivec4(true);\r\nconst uvec2 u = uvec2(false);\r\n\r\nvec3 v2 = vec3(false);\r\nivec4 i2 = ivec4(true);\r\nuvec2 u2 = uvec2(false);\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Testing \r\n\r\nTested locally with the following scenarios:\r\n\r\n1. `vec3(true)` -  evaluates to `vec3(1.0f, 1.0f, 1.0f)` (pass)\r\n2. `vec4(false, true, false, true)` - evaluates to `vec4(0.0f, 1.0f, 0.0f, 1.0f )`  (pass)\r\n3.  `vec3 v = vec3(1 + true);` - throws compile error (expected)\r\n4. `const float arr[] = {true};`  - throws compile error (expected)\r\n5. `float x = false;` - throws compile error (expected, variables need explicit cast)\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120715/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120715/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}